WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
One night, a young man
walks away from his home.

2
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:06.760
He leaves behind his
wife and their baby son.

3
00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:09.250
Buddhists call him the Buddha.

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:14.290
A verse in the Dhammapada warns that care
for sons and a wife binds more strongly

5
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:15.650
than iron.

6
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.830
Yet in Japan today, most
temple priests are married,

7
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.660
with families of their own.

8
00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:23.450
So what do Buddhists really
teach about marriage,

9
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.590
family and sex?

10
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.930
In this mission, you'll meet
two ways of Buddhist life:

11
00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.230
as a monk or nun, or as a householder.

12
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.460
Then you'll read an ancient
sermon on the six directions,

13
00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:38.440
and see where Buddhists today disagree.

14
00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:42.070
Your mission: find out what
Buddhists teach about marriage,

15
00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.650
family and sex.
